---
config:
  fontFamily: "Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif"
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 14px
  gantt:
    useWidth: 1600
    barHeight: 24
    barGap: 6
    topPadding: 60
    sectionFontSize: 14
---
%% The prototype of the simulator, from 2026-11-05 (the first merge after the gap that ends the foundations) to the merge of its UML
%% diagrams. Each bar is a group of related merges of the main branch (git log --first-parent), from the first to the last day of the
%% group, named by the work done. Kept by hand: the other diagrams and the release v0.1.0 get their bars when they are merged.
gantt
    title The simulator: the prototype (5 to 24 Nov 2026)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %d %b
    tickInterval 1week
    todayMarker off

    section Build and CI
    Troubleshooting section                      :done, 2026-11-05, 2026-11-06
    C++23, the X-ray part with MSVC              :done, 2026-11-06, 2026-11-08
    A time limit for the submodule checkout      :done, 2026-11-17, 2026-11-18
    vcpkg baseline, shared GLEW, std. triplets   :done, 2026-11-21, 2026-11-23
    Build instructions, pin guard message        :done, 2026-11-23, 2026-11-25

    section gVirtualXRay
    Its latest commits                           :done, 2026-11-06, 2026-11-07
    The adapter on the Engine's context          :done, 2026-11-09, 2026-11-10
    The adapter kept alive, updated in place     :done, 2026-11-09, 2026-11-10
    Its resize test, and the resize in place     :done, 2026-11-21, 2026-11-24

    section Scene and controls
    Picking and materials                        :done, 2026-11-09, 2026-11-10
    Moving, turning, and scaling the objects     :done, 2026-11-09, 2026-11-10
    A free X-ray tube, finer controls            :done, 2026-11-11, 2026-11-12
    Pixel count, the image seen from the source  :done, 2026-11-14, 2026-11-15

    section 3D view
    Orbit camera, the view in decimetres         :done, 2026-11-12, 2026-11-13
    The tube, the detector, and the beam         :done, 2026-11-12, 2026-11-18

    section Documentation
    The diagram tool                             :done, 2026-11-24, 2026-11-25
    The UML diagrams                             :done, 2026-11-24, 2026-11-25
